+Fixed :issue:`8399`: the internal fixtures generated by :mod:`unittest` integration
+(``setUpClass``/``tearDownClass`` and ``setup_method``/``teardown_method``) are now
+prefixed with an underscore again, and therefore are only shown in
+``pytest --fixtures`` output when the ``-v`` flag is used.
